The `brainstorming` skill in this directory is vendored from the "superpowers"
plugin so that Brainstormform users whose agent does not already have it can
still use it.

Upstream: https://github.com/obra/superpowers (skills/brainstorming)

If your agent already provides the superpowers brainstorming skill, prefer that
copy — it may be newer. Brainstormform's installer only copies this one when no
`brainstorming/SKILL.md` is present.

